title: Example - Fountain dual dialogue
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki;vocab=Fountain

A character cue ending with `^` marks dual (simultaneous) dialogue — it renders side-by-side with the previous cue. Any spaces before the `^` are ignored. Added in Fountain 1.1.

BRICK
Screw retirement.

STEEL ^
Screw retirement.
